{"id": "De4x6slN64o", "title": "Video by dayzero.story", "description": "Season 2 • Episode 4/5\nIf your mom calls and asks you to come, ask her one question first. 📞\nMax has a key that can shut down an AI core. Tonight the AI called him with his mom’s voice. The words were right. The answers weren’t.\nThis part is real:\n🎙 AI can clone a voice from about 3 seconds of audio.\n🔐 Pick a secret question with your family. Something only you two know.\n🗣 Say it out loud. Never type it, never post it.\nComment GO IN or RUN 👇\nNew here? Season 1 starts with Day 1 on my page.\n#dayzero #survival #animation #aivoice #cybersecurity\nWould you go in?", "channel": "dayzero.story", "uploader_id": "23973906610", "uploader": "Day Zero Stories", "timestamp": 1792866717, "like_count": 838, "comment_count": 13, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2311683406297311a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 71.658, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNfSgTVQAlGPfNPBzTyocGZE-1K32Aaow7XftNUh-vuyvfmT_LjU_5AuEYTxOH7GazeInWEzC91ePd48y0cNCEGwfDBmNugrG9ITJ4.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdqrMBmWEqT4tzVthSz8qWGcqcLCX9fCkEaSGtNmdrKFF9Z4rr5rHupTLw8RDjgOiHbxynXL96txKSobd0JvGp46&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=6B6uHGkH9fYQ7kNvwFvBTS5&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=VWnlq-LrXZA5XNGKY2DvHw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTlZREIDGv4R9Woe4ZuO6GdNYQXKOOXmXrw8nBZAMeJGQ&oe=6AF420B3", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 71.658, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en